ursement_summary.md\n===================================================================\n--- /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md\n+++ /Users/douglas/code/masters/sbench/tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md\n@@ -0,0 +1,22 @@\n+# Checkpoint 3: Reimbursement Summary\n+\n+## Totals\n+\n+- Reimbursable total: `$1,056.00`\n+- Non-reimbursable total: `$225.00`\n+\n+## Reimbursable Total Arithmetic\n+\n+`$480.00 + $0.00 + $440.00 + $58.00 + $60.00 + $0.00 + $18.00 = $1,056.00`\n+\n+## Expense Groupings\n+\n+- Fully approved expense IDs: `T-001`, `T-007`\n+- Partially reimbursed or capped expense IDs: `T-003`, `T-004`, `T-005`\n+- Rejected expense IDs: `T-002`, `T-006`\n+\n+## Finance Notes\n+\n+- Total claimed amount across all expenses: `$1,281.00`\n+- Difference between claimed and reimbursable totals: `$1,281.00 - $1,056.00 = $225.00`\n+- Main reductions came from the lodging cap, alcohol exclusion, ride-share tip cap, missing required receipt for supplies, and the non-approved seat upgrade.\n","additions":22,"deletions":0}],"diagnostics":{},"truncated":false},"title":"Success. Updated the following files:\nA tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/policy_application.md\nA tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/expense_decisions.md\nA tasks/travel_reimbursement_audit/answer/reimbursement_summary.md","time":{"start":1781476384620,"end":1781476384638}},"metadata":{"openai":{"itemId":"fc_03429e85c08fcc1e016a2f2c0c9420819197f7ea45d78c9730"}},"id":"prt_ec84410db001gER3DmGh1wVEM6","sessionID":"ses_137bc7233ffe5Qp6x7i47s8Qig","messageID":"msg_ec8440351001HrF1YzaP53TcQ9"}}
